    "subtopic": "Newton's Laws & Friction",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "Block \ud835\udc34 is given an acceleration 12 ms\u22122 towards left as shown in figures. Assuming the block \ud835\udc35 always remains horizontal, find the acceleration (in ms\u22122) of \ud835\udc35",
