    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "Figure represents a painter in a crate which hangs alongside a building. When the painter of mass 100 kg pulls the rope, the force exerted by him on the floor of the crate is 450 N, If the crate weights 25 kg, find the acceleration (in ms\u22122) of the painter",
